{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117160","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1011716001:1":{"text":"埃隆、莱卡等人联合外族，公然在流荧树下破坏神圣的祝祈仪式。","source_cn":"埃隆、莱卡等人联合外族，公然在流荧树下破坏神圣的祝祈仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27CFA6B79F453E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011716002:1":{"text":"荆棘卫士，还不拦下他们？！","source_cn":"荆棘卫士，还不拦下他们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF29953AA233F767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011716003:1":{"text":"是……","source_cn":"是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8A332F701EE151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011716004:1":{"text":"各位，我是薄暮巡游队的队长。这是我们从北方村子里取回的，一位背井离乡之人留下的日记。","source_cn":"各位，我是薄暮巡游队的队长。这是我们从北方村子里取回的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x479EEA297545A8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011716005:1":{"text":"他所在的村子已经被腐化吞没，毫无生机！请看看这篇日记，上面字字血泪！","source_cn":"他所在的村子已经被腐化吞没，毫无生机！请看看这篇日记，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1AB878494033A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl